        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Also note that Mike Pall is currently adding more extensions to LuaJIT (2.1, as backports from the ongoing 3.0 work). So I don't think it makes sense to do this _now_ while aiming for a moving target. It's also not at all clear which -- if any -- of these extensions are actually useful enough for Neovim (core or plugins) to take on the added maintenance and documentation burden. (Part of the reason for sticking to PUC Lua 5.1 is that this is unambiguous and easy to document.)",
